OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case dismissal
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,8,Fattempted suicide
OL,10,FLindsay Clancy, the US woman accused of
OL,11,Fmurdering her three children, has
OL,12,Fappeared in court for the first time
OL,13,Fsince her murder trial fell apart
OL,14,Fearlier this month.
OL,16,FHer defence team on Tuesday argued the
OL,17,Fjudge should dismiss her case but
OL,18,Fprosecutors said the state had "met its
OL,19,Fburden" in proving her guilt.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
