OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appears in court as her
OL,4,Alawyer pushes for murder case dismissal
OL,5,
OL,6,FClancy, 36, does not deny killing her
OL,7,Fthree children in 2023, but her defence
OL,8,Fteam argues she was suffering from
OL,9,Fsevere postpartum psychosis at the
OL,10,Ftime. Prosecutors say the killings were
OL,11,Fintentional.
